  - m_Id: 219731245330432
    m_Localized: Luggage game
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 220113489031168
    m_Localized: Try to remember the following items and put them  in the suitcase. 
      To unlock an objective, you need to complete the ones before it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
