  - m_Id: 980179829846016
    m_Localized: Drag the t-shirt into the suitcase and let go.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 980641584967680
    m_Localized: Tap and hold on an item to reveal it's name.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 981056879783936
    m_Localized: Not every drawer has an item inside it. Return to your room and
      check the other drawers.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 981263440867328
    m_Localized: You can tap here to check out the items you need in case you have
      forgotten any.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 981342667075584
    m_Localized: Tap and hold on the yellow t-shirt.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1007719978037248
    m_Localized: Tap on the suitcase to check its contents.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1008035591024640
    m_Localized: Tap on the icon down below to close the suitcase.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1008127668580352
    m_Localized: You may check the contents of a drawer by tapping on it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1008270274916352
    m_Localized: You may drag an item out the suitacase to take it out.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1008625826066432
    m_Localized: You can tap here to check out the items you need in case you have
      forgotten any.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1009206221271040
    m_Localized: Check your luggagee and tap on the plane icon to start your vacation.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1010056146644992
    m_Localized: The number indicates the number of times you may check the list.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1010146311598080
    m_Localized: Return the t-shirt to the suitcase.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1010287504453632
    m_Localized: You may tap on the icon at your right to go to the bathroom.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1010463212236800
    m_Localized: Check the drawers and tap the icon to return.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1010595878072320
    m_Localized: Tap and hold the yellow t-shirt.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1389778280030208
    m_Localized: Are you sure you have finished?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
